      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of being a placeholder is a heavy weight to carry, and it sounds like you're carrying a lot of self-judgment right now. But being a placeholder doesn't mean you have no value; it just means your current definition of value is too narrow. Maybe instead of trying to build something huge, you could focus on one small thing that feels even slightly less empty today.",
